\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2  Tanigaki: Have Plenty Of Funds For  \highlight22\uc2 FX Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 251 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 November 2003\par 07:34\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 TOKYO (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  has plenty of funds to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market if needed, Finance Minister Sadakazu Tanigaki said Wednesday, countering reports that Tokyo is running short of ammunition in its campaign to curb the yen's rise.  \par \par \uc2 Testifying before a parliamentary budget committee, Tanigaki said his ministry hasn't asked the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  to provide more \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  funds, calling media reports that such a plan is in the works "speculative."  \par \par \uc2 But the ministry was "always considering various ways to ensure that we can act quickly and flexibly in the market," he said.  \par \par \uc2 The furious pace of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's yen-selling campaign - \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  have hit a record Y16.2 trillion and counting on the year - has raised the possibility that the ministry could soon hit the cumulative Y79 trillion ceiling on the amount of funds it can borrow to finance \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 The Nihon Keizai Shimbun reported last month that the MOF and the BOJ were mulling a proposal for the government to sell a portion of its roughly Y50 trillion worth of U.S. Treasurys and other foreign bond holdings in order to finance further \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 MOF officials have repeatedly denied they were working on such a plan, and BOJ Governor Toshihiko Fukui said last week the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  hadn't received any such request from the ministry.  \par \par \uc2 -By Jonathan Soble, Dow Jones Newswires; 813-5255-2929; jonathan.soble@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Bennett Richardson  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020031126dzbq0008u\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
