): EUR2.5M (EUR7.5M) \par Forecast range: EUR3.2M loss -  EUR8.1M profit \par Note: Fall in net profit amid uncertainties about average tax rate and performance of key contracts. Analysts eager to see whether jump in operating margin at offshore division recorded in 2Q extends to 3Q. Downpayments collected for new contracts should help company reduce debt, they say. \par  \par Royal & Sun Alliance (RSA.LN): 3Q Earnings \par Note: Royal & Sun Alliance (RSA.L) 3Q operating profit seen Thu at GBP530M for the 9- mo to Sep 30, +13% from GBP471M in '02, according to figures provided by the company based on 7 analysts' forecasts. Range seen GBP508M-GBP573M. Analysts will be looking for news of the company's progress since a GBP950M rights issue in Sep. \par  \par Lastminute.com (LMC.LN): FY Earnings \par Note: Lastminute.com (LMC.L) seen Thu reporting FY pretax profit before goodwill and exceptionals of GBP7.7M, compared with loss of GBP16.2M a year ago, according to consensus forecast from 8 analysts compiled by the company. 4Q profit on same basis seen GBP10.5M-GBP16.6M. Steady demand for short vacations - Lastminute.com's specialty - fueled earnings uptick, analysts say, although Germany, France may have been challenging, says one. \par  \par OTHER SCHEDULED EVENTS: \par  \par Scapa Group (SCPA.LN): 1H Earnings \par  \par Hilton (HG.LN): Trading Statement \par  \par Babcock Intl (BAB.LN): 1H Earnings \par  \par Cardpoint (CASH.LN): FY Earnings \par  \par FKI Group (FKI.LN): 1H Earnings \par  \par Titan (TITK.AT): 9-Mos Earnings \par  \par Primary Health (PHP.LN): AGM \par  \par Madisons Coffee (MCF.LN): AGM \par  \par Manchester & London (MNL.LN): AGM \par  \par Schroders (SDR.LN): Trading Update \par  \par Real Software (REA.BT): 3Q Earnings \par  \par Bilfinger Berger (GBF.XE): 3Q Earnings \par  \par GBL (GBLB.BT): 3Q Earnings \par  \par Bertelsmann (BRT.YY): 3Q Earnings \par  \par WestLB (WLB.YY): Capital markets conference  with Fresenius CEO, Lufthansa and Deutsche