\par\par \b \uc2 Japan MOF mulls turning to BOJ for  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  funds-sources.  \b0\par\par\uc2 500 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Oktober 2003\par 05:28\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2  TOKYO, Oct 28 (Reuters) - Japan's \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  may raise funds for its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by selling foreign bond holdings to the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  if such steps become necessary, ministry sources said on Tuesday.   \par \par \uc2  Yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the ministry to curb the yen's strength hit a record 13.5 trillion yen ($124.5 billion) in the first nine months of the year, and its \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  account has come within 12-13 trillion yen of its 79 trillion yen borrowing limit.   \par \par \uc2  The ceiling is due to be raised by 20 trillion yen or so in the budget for 2004/05, starting next April, or in an extra budget for the current fiscal year. Meantime the MOF is keen to head off any speculation about a possible fund shortage.   \par \par \uc2  "At this point, we still have some room under the ceiling for our \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  funds and we're not taking any action yet," said a ministry source.   \par \par \uc2  "But we will consider necessary measures if, for instance, speculation arises in the market that our hands are tied behind our backs because of fund shortages in the future."   \par \par \uc2  The MOF source, as well as a BOJ source, said the ministry had yet to make any specific requests to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2  The ministry has huge holdings of U.S. Treasury bills and notes as a result of years of yen-selling - or dollar buying - \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2  Under one arrangement being considered, the ministry could sell those securities to the BOJ under a repurchase agreement and receive the initial payment in yen. That would effectively look like a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swap \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2 , buying some time for the MOF if the borrowing ceiling became a serious issue.   \par \par \uc2  The BOJ has so far refused to buy foreign bonds on its own as part of its monetary easing steps, saying that would affect exchange rates, which fall under the MOF's jurisdiction.   \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has also been worried about taking on \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  risks, given that the health of its balance sheet backs up the credibility of the nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2  But BOJ Governor Fukui said recently that the BOJ had cooperated with the MOF's funding for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  several times over the past century. A government source said one such example was with regard to the 1987 Louvre Accord.   \par \par \uc2  The Louvre Accord was drawn up by the Group of Seven to halt an excessive slide in the dollar that followed the 1985 Plaza Accord, which was designed to weaken the overvalued dollar and correct a widening U.S. trade deficit.   \par \par \uc2  Although the Japanese government's heavy \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been criticised by authorities abroad, Tokyo is worried that a rapid rise in the yen would choke off Japan's export-led economic recovery.   \par \par \uc2  The dollar fell to three-year lows around 108.20 yen  on Tuesday, down 10 percent from its recent peaks above 120 yen about three months ago. ($1=108.43 Yen).   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020031028dzas000us\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
